      <slug></slug>
      <title>QuantumSTEP</title>
      <subtitle>new frameworks and future directions</subtitle>
      <track>GNUstep Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;QuantumSTEP is a technology study framework and application&#xA;suite that is partially based on GNUstep. It aims at consequently&#xA;using Objective-C on embedded and portable devices. This talk&#xA;describes the latest additions to the frameworks: CoreLocation,&#xA;MKMapKit, CoreWLAN, CoreTelephony and demonstrates how&#xA;they work on the new GTA04 hardware.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="3401">Nikolaus Schaller</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>